00:00:28.580 --> 00:00:30.660
WE ARE THE WOKKING DEAD!!!!!!!

00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:41.660
Theme: We are the Wokking Dead! (The Wokking Dead) We are the Wokking Dead!!!

