CZsWorld and Culinart Productions are not responsible if you DIE from eating this recipe.

00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:07.260
Nor are we responsible for what happens... to that baby!!

00:01:07.260 --> 00:01:12.200
Dave: Whoa, whoa! Yes we are Cordon. You probably got Child Protective Services called on us!

00:01:13.680 --> 00:01:16.560
Cordon: Ah, shut up Dave! ...Producers...

00:01:16.960 --> 00:01:19.280
Anyways, you'll need these items:

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:20.600
Oils.

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:21.860
Sauces.

00:01:22.940 --> 00:01:23.500
Plants!

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:25.460
A sharp knife.

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:28.520
Pork. Wonton wrappers.

00:01:28.860 --> 00:01:29.980
And of course...

00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:32.160
The Wokking Dead!

00:01:33.180 --> 00:01:34.860
Also some corn starch...

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:38.580
But first, finely chop the vegetables.

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:40.040
*metal montage*

00:01:51.660 --> 00:01:52.940
Now put in the bowl.

00:01:56.340 --> 00:01:57.540
And refrigerate.

00:01:57.540 --> 00:02:00.500
Alright, let's see if there's any room in here...

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:08.920
Now you're gonna need some of these things.

00:02:10.180 --> 00:02:14.420
Add a shot a cornstarch with a cup of water, and you'll need this.

00:02:16.460 --> 00:02:18.780
This is what we use to kill the baby.

00:02:20.520 --> 00:02:23.000
Throw the other stuff in the garbage.

00:02:23.960 --> 00:02:26.760
And put the baby's head in the mixing bowl.

00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:36.920
Alright! Take this, and smash until well blended.

00:02:37.360 --> 00:02:41.280
Dave: Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa! Cordon! Are you crazy?

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:45.880
Dave: Child Protective Services is right outside the building. You're gonna get us shut down!

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:49.080
Cordon: It's just a human baby!

00:02:51.420 --> 00:02:58.420
Anyways, you'll make little eyeballs out of the brain matter. Brains need oxygen to survive, so make it a super tight seal.

00:02:58.740 --> 00:03:00.100
Now set those aside.

00:03:00.100 --> 00:03:03.320
And as promised by the title of this thing you're watching...

00:03:04.840 --> 00:03:11.000
Then you put the wontons in the wok. Get those suckers in there. Nice and airtight baby brain.

00:03:11.520 --> 00:03:14.560
Once you've done that, add 2.5 shots of water.

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:17.400
Two....

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:19.040
And a half....

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:27.720
Now set the heat to medium inferno, because things are about to get steamy.

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:31.640
Ooh! Yeah!!

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:40.200
Now let's remove these "babies" from the Wok.

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:44.220
Alright! Get it in there! Yeah. Yeah.

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:48.400
Cover it with sauce! Augh!!

00:03:49.740 --> 00:03:53.580
Now it's ready to serve to the horde. Let's give them a try.

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:58.320
Offscreen: This is Child Protective Services! Put your hands where I can see them!

00:03:59.240 --> 00:04:01.240
CPS: Hey! What are you doing?!

00:04:01.620 --> 00:04:02.820
Cordon: BRAINS!!

00:04:02.820 --> 00:04:04.840
CPS: Get back! I said get back!!

00:04:05.880 --> 00:04:06.920
*screaming for help*

00:04:06.920 --> 00:04:07.660
CPS: Oh sh--

